ological split) with validation on the remaining 20%.\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| RMSE | 4.6687 |\n| MAE | 3.8659 |\n| MAPE | 6.0131% |\n\nKey details:\n- **Data**: 365 daily ICU occupancy records (Jan–Dec 2023), range 30–85, mean ~59.\n- **Architecture**: LSTM(64) → Dense(32, ReLU) → Dense(7), Adam optimizer, MSE loss.\n- **Training**: Early stopping at epoch 107 (patience=20), batch size 16, internal validation split 20%.\n- **Test RMSE**: **4.6687** — reasonable given the data's standard deviation of ~10.6.\n- **Output file**: `test_performance.csv` saved with columns `Metric` and `Value`.\n\nThe output file `test_performance.csv` has been generated at:\n`/mnt/data/lengyang/youjia_project/autoba/BABench/src/promptbio-bench/tasks/b-8-5/result_79/toolsgenie_20260709/data/test_performance.csv`"], 'input_token_num': 49843, 'output_token_num': 10302}
